      "title": "AI Protest in Montreal",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://montrealgazette.com/news/photos-anti-ai-protest-in-montreal/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49755162\nPoints: 31\n# Comments: 22",
      "body": "As thousands of artificial intelligence industry people gathered in Montreal along with federal AI Minister Evan Solomon on Wednesday, opponents of AI held a protest outside.\nAnti-AI protester Jorick Ysaak Malletter uses chalk to post a message on the sidewalk prior to the march. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nAnti-AI protesters say AI-generated flyers and internet memes aren’t worth the consumption of fresh water by the industry. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nAnti-AI protesters march on René-Lévesque Blvd. in Montreal Wednesday. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nAnti-AI protesters march through the streets. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nAnti-AI protesters march on René-Lévesque Blvd. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nA riot police officer stops anti-AI protesters from crossing René-Lévesque Blvd. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nAnti-AI protest in Montreal. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nAnti-AI protest in Montreal. John Mahoney / Montreal Gazette\nMeet Scientist AI, Montreal’s bid to ‘leapfrog’ ChatGPT without killing us all\nMontreal building vandalized, covered with graffiti referencing AI, police say",
