      "id": "hackernews-2026-09-18-ask-a-monk-a-digital-wilderness-for-thoughts-with-no-immedia",
      "title": "Ask A Monk – A digital wilderness for thoughts with no immediate answer",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://askamonk.online\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49749171\nPoints: 43\n# Comments: 24",
      "body": "There is no AI here.Every answer comes from a human.Some things are easier to tell a stranger.Some questions stay with us for years.We carry them through the noise of daily life—until a quiet moment brings them back.Sometimes we stop asking because we think nobody would understand.But another person has lived through the very same night.They cannot fix your life. But they may listen, and help you carry it for a while.That's what strangers do for each other. Here.To the strangers who keep answering.You don't leave a name. We don't know who you are.\nBut every honest reply, written for someone you'll never meet,\nis what makes this place real.Thank you.",
