      "id": "bbc-2026-09-17-champion-van-gerwen-loses-in-first-round-to-gurney",
      "title": "Champion Van Gerwen loses in first round to Gurney",
      "summary": "Defending champion Michael van Gerwen falls to a 6-5 defeat by Daryl Gurney in the opening round of the World Series of Darts Finals in Amsterdam.",
      "body": "Defending champion Michael van Gerwen fell to a 6-5 defeat by Daryl Gurney in the opening round of the World Series of Darts Finals in Amsterdam.Northern Ireland's Gurney raced into a 3-0 lead before the Dutch top seed reeled off five consecutive legs to put himself on the brink of victory. However, Gurney, who was drafted in as a late replacement when Lourence Ilagan withdrew from the 32-man field, responded by taking the ninth leg.And when Van Gerwen missed six match darts, he was able to level the match at 5-5 and win the decider with the throw.Gurney will now take on England's Ross Smith in the last 16 on Saturday after he advanced past Kevin Doets 6-3. World number one Luke Littler will get under way on Friday against former UK Open champion Danny Noppert, having recently whitewashed the Dutchman 6-0 on his way to winning the Czech Darts Open.World number two Luke Humphries also emerged victorious in another England versus Netherlands encounter, progressing 6-4 against Jermaine Wattimena.Dutch number one Gian van Veen gained a measure of revenge for the home fans with a 6-2 triumph over Chris Dobey. Dirk van Duijvenbode fought back from 4-1 down to defeat Sweden's Viktor Tingstrom 6-4, while Ryan Searle threw four 180s as he dispatched former world champion Rob Cross 6-2. Searle goes on to play Josh Rock, who won the last three legs to edge out Stephen Bunting 6-5.Karel Sedlacek marked his debut at the tournament with a 6-4 win over New Zealander Ben Robb and will take on Van Veen next.",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "world",
      "tags": [],
      "author": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-17T21:38:38.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/branded_sport/1200/cpsprodpb/8a43/live/bfa1b070-b2dc-11f1-b227-bbba053e356a.jpg",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/darts/articles/crje8nkdkj28o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
