      "body": "Welcome to the Interim Computer Museum Online!\nThe Interim Computer Museum (ICM) strives to preserve and\nshare the history of computing through interactive exhibits\nusing vintage hardware with modern enhancements. Our\nexhibits provide a hands-on experience that bridges the past\nand the present, allowing visitors to explore the evolution of\nWe are a 501(c)(3) non-profit charity in partnership with the membership\norganization SDF Public Access UNIX System, Inc. 501(c)(7).\nMembership is crucial to our mission which supports the museum's activities\nthrough community events, remote access and artifact preservation.\nPlease click on Visit for contact and\nbooking information.To support our efforts, consider Donating or Joining us today.\n(and other frequently asked questions)",
